Algorithm:
Insert (Front)
1. Create a new node with given text.
2. Point newNode->next = head.
3. Update head = newNode.
Insert (End)
1. Create a new node with next = NULL.
2. If list empty → head = newNode.
3. Else traverse till last node and link it.
Insert (Position)
1. Traverse list until (pos-1)th node.
2. Insert new node after it.
Delete (Front)
1. If list empty → return.
2. Move head = head->next.
3. Free old first node.
Delete (End)
1. Traverse till second last node.
2. Free last node.
3. Update secondLast->next = NULL.
Delete (Position)
1. Traverse till (pos-1)th node.
2. Bypass (pos)th node.
3. Free deleted node.
Display
 Traverse from head → print each line.
Display Reverse
 Use recursion: visit next node first, then print.

